{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1197,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73ec3c21e1078379fb55855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员喜欢吃巧克力吗？\r\n那你看一下包包里面。\r\n呵呵，这是我给你的小惊喜♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6962bae36ee222c33ae859be7d05e7df9be1bdbae200ef8793a6f833cce7a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:638b90f83c7efe9d39160b96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个……是我为你准备的。\r\n哈哈，用开玩笑的语气说都没事，\r\n正经地说就觉得……很害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0760da723b0c3f510ae55f8766caa795e872468a8a00dc984c096fcbd7c392b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397875bdf760e49893096c9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是我的话，即使没有银河，\r\n我也会去见织女的。\r\n为了向夜空送上我的「奇迹」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6af220e24063b225117b2d953bf77d2065601c49221ca7e5c9c68b8d9618ca2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:941a86ee63c69dcc47aaf060",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！呵呵。\r\n那么，我该为训练员准备\r\n怎样的惊喜好呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b6c5bb42d9c9630016b963775e26cad0a4bd93fe71435d145ef806bc509042a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0c32dc83f8b647121b13f08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你小时候相信圣诞老人的存在吗？\r\n我现在都还是相信哦。\r\n因为这样比较有趣嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e923eb1450760e7527df2035dd448fa8575500c4a89c9215eecd20c0c6337309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:774b52bdb338902f0f318b6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐！\r\n如果你有空的话，\r\n请务必让我带你一起过圣诞节哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d11cda2796651406da133516e273fa69f4adec12eab63cfd643b293b0cca072",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3071724f68b090ab69247a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2683e66cffb291becf9fcf9338654b262ec1dc080788adf243d2d90ddf838de8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de5b7e9ae6fbb89fe6544e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍也有大扫除的时候，当中还有\r\n想跑掉不帮忙的人呢，呵呵。\r\n那时候就是快乐的追逐战时间了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7abbe0bee2ee1a7a0b7c6324460fa8f46aa4d14e08954bc6d0fe1d9db7e8c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa59c30bd4105a476ff0c8af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n难得的日子，\r\n我希望带给你最棒的回忆当作礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eb7e1cd6753b108d04d97cff0bf33cf1dedc515905f018202a9c7735094e1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d776c662d1a993a4bdcbdce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想到这是纪念你出生的日子，\r\n我就会自然地露出笑容……\r\n生日快乐，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40b9d4d21287fc40a67a626fdae3b1a512c33f179940f3e13f1efe016f12b220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f7b8c2190aaab63ad13e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能够用超越笑容的东西，\r\n来回馈送礼物的大家，\r\n我还要更努力精进自己才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42cfca235e420951f4a52153ec099834a51b7bb5d6e1bf9ae4dd41ac5697721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d25a01fd179ff2ea636e8ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有你帮我过生日，\r\n我真是幸福的人。\r\n谢谢你，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de44273f9964367275464977775b266b4991a432fc063832f81a301d678c05a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca3bee8c7d120537e9d9f577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告呢。\r\n趁忘记之前，\r\n还是先确认一下比较好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea98088378791d48524f3f2c3007e25a29180fc61c48981da5f05c91d6deaff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18749d1457530d3ec21e44b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦。\r\n呵呵，能因为这样看见你的笑容吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b105c4bf73c3a7f8540d8e90fa52ac5cd06b25c8d1341f7427007a0e5e1403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:190c5061fdf306dbf72feffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了，恭喜你！\r\n付出总是有回报的。\r\n也不枉费你这么努力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82b487cd707df38de57d418182e349390616689658521dbafc1c1b8d5198ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25a509330497587200d169c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎正在准备活动呢。\r\n既然自称是表演家，\r\n就没有理由不参加！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc641a65c0eac93f0f588c6852305310cc9844d8c76ceeedbe13b075c0e7aec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef8852211ca6017ea43f8282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了呢。\r\n我们一起去好好享受吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "911bc18fecabe549d4e9c47d65156552cd05a5f631430385c53cd23c21c5d2a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3798db1469967d8bb88aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真没面子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eab88256532f9920f77cc322d169b5f5cd48296c08d01cb0748527537a80527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ab2de0e54079e545e8e24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级好像提升了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e40d5c7a44cbaa247370ddb23638ef87d1e861231270e5fed7059854d4c3f8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1387088f4877faf02748907b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "動きやすくてなによりポニーちゃん\r\nたちからの評判もいいからね！\r\n私はパンツスタイルが好きなんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e0fb00433483a8024fc6c745dc0ad5949c64c3c17a14e550553fa7019e55fa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00c51ad867f6a7786edfa39f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ポッケが私の服装を真似ようとして\r\nいたから、止めたよ。彼女には自分\r\nらしさを突き詰めてほしいからね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c1d2629a6f5f611261a5c72199e9c097d96a0cd922eb6e1bbebd9a6e7488755",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea88fb7ea6f2736770994a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母からオンとオフは切り替えるべき\r\nと教わっているけど…声をかけられ\r\nるとつい応えたくなっちゃうんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbc0e0fd7d708ed9f8edd397203cc3c57dcd886ef44cf38fa1cbb4b23944952d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1033c5db590eee4a0c81de5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好激烈的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d400e30ff2d3b6f7e4bb3a3878adffd68daef1d5150acadb034ecdec7ea28a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c4552281b3b87e8e278606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都多亏了大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbeeec7886bd9658b6cc44b553bd217bc29cd5205bd47fb9ba64d9a43f07073b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13dd0c9fdc21482bf45514a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真没面子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eab88256532f9920f77cc322d169b5f5cd48296c08d01cb0748527537a80527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dcdaa455bbd7ab9e55d8a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好激烈的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44d400e30ff2d3b6f7e4bb3a3878adffd68daef1d5150acadb034ecdec7ea28a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3f0e14ed7796e5edb30fe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好，创下最高分了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "013783ff474f6554e9e674606d217c6cf66362b83bf742ae5dec6ef5c488cd7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2582d63a4c6edf7be3b74e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a7c373bad24969da6e32fe6afee7b381fad4af6cc62b0a385fe0793f2faa3b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efd73ebf0672441e75bb0aef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要尽情地享受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b7c8279f0fcbfd5faaddceb81accd02277f2b61f7996c7936dd5f070738c49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb17671e7430b0c07541041",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "揭幕的时候到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e09c41cb985eb512d6457ac68ab13ec4c0be59fca1420c2adc57316c80682721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41bc1cea188bb5ea53288d48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是团体战哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2636e38da0f9ad63840cf36c25e572f88b82c60acd8253db5c993e5a4483d03b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c9d8ce41b955f33312ef4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75c8fce49f16d17c43103a76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想要开始怎样的训练呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45eb0e53bf035417e3b166535ba37ecb678e46e90bfcb59c88df4f03f8217bb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c8127a82fae849433eb92b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要聊过去的回忆，我陪你吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b848250a49e9478818939d56c6f561d9505fd4f2d37aa7799a38ab011a620272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc2fdff5576f5c4c1fcdc43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名参赛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1780b9d9509091647fdd66392e17bd7d501748732aee70930d3ae20c7bcd6e41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cc96a010bb2b8c52b28a43c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:930b72e32799c9ab8eb910a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉到了，这份温暖是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a32c7dbee5d8e54b86207b4457f24ccad7bf774f949cf6587d72d659e43d51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd5e0e05c2c9cb4a38de6be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c04f1c38e3c73e8fe05becd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很期待哦，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f32aedc6f210e1f3dfe4bd1eacc4db9951a33a6509a72262465a9136184f00e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0fb68b6298c8dbd1f98f8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d274fbb8726de6608c24a61f78c8db4bbc7d74e06bb6efd0e871dfbf618e2a0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7da5485a526c90a71f5b495",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af35ab30ab7387dd59f5ff41e479718e0e2fa44f6e3c73ea45ba2b061597a8a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d1d4a59ad8e02c4bcfaa48a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛！大丰收呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34e98a8b8f696e3a3131bae93a0a0da5746ff3e5b7edb7f95c7da7058ce679f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7919089b4f4e79ba8f076b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "结果算还可以吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea711ebdd9f5a55b6502c113f39f63ceffa8550c813b6bc37d4041b8a8c9c9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:855725f9a826c33adea978d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有下次机会，别沮丧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb53e4d6c4ee7e92ebcc051dd5a9071560e9af85e84af6e3dd9d473b0c77e4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f00fa21b4d5d232b82d1ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛！大丰收呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34e98a8b8f696e3a3131bae93a0a0da5746ff3e5b7edb7f95c7da7058ce679f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
